<title>SENEGAL: Senegal cancels deal with Swedish telecom company.</title>
<headline>Senegal cancels deal with Swedish telecom company.</headline>
<dateline>DAKAR 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senegal has cancelled a provisional deal with a consortium led by Swedish Telia Overseas for the privatisation of the state telecommunication company SONATEL, privatisation committee officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The government has decided to cancel the provisional deal with the consortium led by Telia Overseas concerning a third of the capital of SONATEL,&quot; a committee spokesman said.</p>
</text>
